title: "Subtail: deciding subtype entailment over bottom and binary product"
authors:
  - name: "Author names pending (placeholder)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mhenglein/subtail"
url: "https://github.com/mhenglein/subtail"
abstract: >-
  Research repository for C081: a Lean-checked executable decision for finite
  expression constraints over bottom and one covariant binary product, with
  arbitrary possibly infinite trees. Includes an ordinary proof draft,
  declaration maps, experiments and preserved research history. Licensing is
  pending; this metadata grants no license. Novelty, quantitative bounds,
  practical performance and extensions are separate research questions.
keywords:
  - subtype entailment
  - infinite trees
  - decidability
  - Lean
  - automata
